<title>USA: CCC AMENDS SHIPMENT PERIOD FOR PAKISTAN TENDER.</title>
<headline>CCC AMENDS SHIPMENT PERIOD FOR PAKISTAN TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it has amended the shipment period for its Pakistan wheat tender.</p>
<p>On August 5, the CCC said it was seeking on August 12 up to 30,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 or better soft white wheat for donation to Pakistan.</p>
<p>The shipment period is now slated for November 1 to November 30 instead of August 24-September 18 as stated previously.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
